<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/paul-reed/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/paul-reed/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Paul Reed Paid in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reed earns $5.6m in 2026-27, ninth at Detroit and the last year of his contract. It rises from $5.34m last season. His career earnings reach $22.57m across seven seasons. The salary is 2.94% of the club’s $190.68m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Paul Reed Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract ends after this season. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in the summer of 2027 at 28, with seven NBA seasons behind him."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Paul Reed Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $5.6m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Paul Reed’s Contract Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reed is in the second year of a two-year contract worth $10.94m that he signed with Detroit in 2025 under Early Bird rights, of which $5.34m was guaranteed. This season was unprotected until January 10, 2027. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 28."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Paul Reed’s Net Worth in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reed’s net worth is estimated at around $9.03m, taken from his $22.57m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played three seasons at DePaul and Philadelphia took him 58th in 2020, two picks from the end of that draft. He turned 21 a week after it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Paul Reed on $5.6m in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reed is paid $5.6m because a center who rebounds and defends is useful at almost any price, and a 58th pick never gets to argue about what that price is. Almost every contract he has signed has had a guarantee date attached to it."}}]}</script>
